==Battleground==
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s (2,400%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kroxo]] (400%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Nimoy Bore]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stack [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocats]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarers]], and [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cats]] before hitting the base. Ideally, you want to take out the Nimoy Bore and destroy the base before anything else spawns. Meatshields are not necessary; in fact, they might even trigger Loris's attacks, which you don't want. If you have to spawn meatshields in order to stack, stop before hitting the base. When the first Nimoy Bore dies, rush down the base.

